---
import BaseLayout from '@layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import '@/styles/prose.css';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="About Denartes - the development alias of Joel Dickinson."
>
  <section class="about-page">
    <div class="container">
      <article class="about-content">
        <h1>About</h1>
        
        <div class="prose">
          <p>
            <strong>Denartes</strong> is the development alias of Joel Dickinson.
          </p>
          
          <p>
            This site is a workshop for software projects, a notebook for technical writing, 
            and an archive of experiments, development notes, and lessons learned along the way.
          </p>
          
          <p>
            The work here focuses on developer tools, productivity software, and the craft of 
            building useful, well-considered software. Some projects are polished products, 
            others are exploratory prototypes, and some are simply documentation of ideas 
            that didn't work out—but were worth recording anyway.
          </p>
          
          <h2>What you'll find here</h2>
          
          <ul>
            <li>
              <strong>Projects</strong> — Open source tools, applications, and libraries. 
              Each project page explains what it does, its current status, and links to 
              the source code.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Writing</strong> — Technical articles, development journals, release notes, 
              and reflections on the craft. Posts range from detailed tutorials to brief notes 
              on problems solved.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Experiments</strong> — Prototypes and explorations that may or may not 
              become full projects. Some ideas need to be built to be understood.
            </li>
          </ul>
          
          <h2>Approach</h2>
          
          <p>
            The projects and writing here reflect a preference for:
          </p>
          
          <ul>
            <li>Solving real problems over chasing trends</li>
            <li>Simplicity and clarity over unnecessary complexity</li>
            <li>Thoughtful design over feature accumulation</li>
            <li>Learning in public and documenting the journey</li>
          </ul>
          
          <h2>Connect</h2>
          
          <p>
            The best way to follow the work is through the <a href="/blog/">writing</a> on this site 
            or via the <a href="/rss.xml">RSS feed</a>.
          </p>
          
          <p>
            Source code for projects can be found on <a href="https://github.com/denartes" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a>.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-page {
    padding-block: var(--space-12);
  }

  .about-content {
    max-width: var(--max-width-content);
  }

  .about-content h1 {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-8);
  }
</style>
